WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:13.816
Dog told a story first.

2
00:00:13.817 --> 00:00:22.103
Pig and Cow went next.

3
00:00:22.104 --> 00:00:25.887
"I will tell a story now," said Bat.

4
00:00:25.888 --> 00:00:31.306
"It is a good one.

5
00:00:31.307 --> 00:00:34.970
But it is very spooky!"

6
00:00:34.971 --> 00:00:37.585
"Good," said Dog.

7
00:00:37.586 --> 00:00:42.719
"I like spooky stories!"

8
00:00:42.720 --> 00:00:47.103
"Once there was a mean witch," said Bat.

9
00:00:47.104 --> 00:00:50.505
"The witch had a black cape.

10
00:00:50.506 --> 00:00:57.548
The witch . . . "

11
00:00:57.549 --> 00:01:01.697
Cat and Pig and Cow fell asleep.

12
00:01:01.698 --> 00:01:04.571
Dog and Bat were still awake.

13
00:01:04.572 --> 00:01:06.539
Hoot-hoot.

14
00:01:06.541 --> 00:01:09.510
"What's that?" said Dog.

15
00:01:09.511 --> 00:01:12.886
"I do not hear anything," said Bat.

16
00:01:12.887 --> 00:01:15.372
Woo-woo.

17
00:01:15.373 --> 00:01:26.968
"What's that?" said Dog.

18
00:01:26.969 --> 00:01:29.287
Cow woke up.

19
00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:33.221
"I do not hear anything," she said.

20
00:01:33.222 --> 00:01:40.610
"I hear sounds," Dog cried.

21
00:01:40.611 --> 00:01:47.024
"Really spooky sounds!"

22
00:01:47.025 --> 00:01:51.103
"What are you doing, Dog?" asked Cat.

23
00:01:51.104 --> 00:01:54.844
"Where are you going?" asked Bat.

24
00:01:54.845 --> 00:01:59.409
"I do not like camping," Dog said.

25
00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:15.978
"I am going home!"

